        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Currently, we offer title insurance services in a majority of our markets and on both the acquisition and resale side of the transaction.",
        "start_character": 12283,
        "end_character": 12420
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to these products, we also offer customers integrated title insurance and escrow services through our subsidiaries.",
        "start_character": 12155,
        "end_character": 12282
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the markets where our title services are offered, we provided these services for over 80% of Opendoor home transactions that closed in 2025.",
        "start_character": 12421,
        "end_character": 12564
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our platform combines product design and operations to create what we believe will be the future of how people buy or sell a home.",
        "start_character": 667,
        "end_character": 797
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These factors are reflected in our spreads, which we define as total discount to our home valuation at the time of offer, less our 5% service fee.",
        "start_character": 22068,
        "end_character": 22214
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our various subsidiaries, we also buy and sell homes, provide real estate brokerage, title insurance and settlement services, operate a mortgage business, and provide other product offerings, which results in us receiving or facilitating transmission of personal information.",
        "start_character": 40733,
        "end_character": 41016
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To provide the broad range of products and services that we offer customers, certain of our subsidiaries maintain real estate brokerage, title insurance and escrow, mortgage and general contractor licenses, and we may in the future apply for additional licenses as our business grows and develops.",
        "start_character": 41673,
        "end_character": 41970
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on continuing to refine our best-in-class seller experience, expand integrated services that capture additional transaction value, invest in enhancing the buyer experience, and create a seamless, vertically-integrated platform.",
        "start_character": 32485,
        "end_character": 32727
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We manage inventory performance by listing cohort and by market, with our pricing models designed to achieve target margins while maintaining appropriate transaction velocity and portfolio health.",
        "start_character": 19833,
        "end_character": 20029
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a number of products designed to meet different seller and buyer needs while leveraging a common technology, pricing, and operations platform.",
        "start_character": 9105,
        "end_character": 9256
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we estimate over one-half of home sellers are also home buyers.",
        "start_character": 8222,
        "end_character": 8299
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001801169-26-000010",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001801169-26-000010-11f37b7a4b056c62",
        "accession_number": "0001801169-26-000010",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As the principal in the transaction rather than an intermediary, we operate from a structurally advantageous position.",
        "start_character": 19509,
        "end_character": 19627
      }
    ]
